    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A magic javelin. When you hit with it you can deal Lightning damage instead of Piercing (use <strong>Attack (Lightning)</strong>). <strong>Lightning Bolt</strong> (once per dawn): instead of a ranged attack, the javelin becomes a 5-ft-wide line to a target within 120 ft; the target and each other creature in the line makes a DC 13 DEX save, taking 4d6 Lightning damage (half on a success), then the javelin returns to your hand.</p>",
